#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveAuto), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:45
msgid "Enable Automatic Free/Busy Retrieval"
msgstr "Free-/Bunnen-Daten automaatsch halen"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyFullDomainRetrieval), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:50
msgid "Use full email address for retrieval"
msgstr "Bi't Halen hele Nettpostadress bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyFullDomainRetrieval), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:51
msgid ""
"With this setting, you can change the filename that will be fetched from the "
"server. With this checked, it will download a free/busy file called "
"user@domain.ifb, for example nn@kde.org.ifb. Without this set, it will "
"download user.ifb, for example nn.ifb."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Instellen ännerst Du den Dateinaam, na den op den Server keken "
"warrt. Is dat anmaakt, warrt en Free-/Bunnendatei mit den Naam "
"\"bruker@domään.ifb\" daallaadt, a.B. \"nn@kde.org.ifb\". Is dit utmaakt, "
"warrt \"bruker.ifb\" daallaadt, a.B. \"nn.ifb\"."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveUrl), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:56
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval URL"
msgstr "Free-/Bunnen-Afhaal-URL"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveUser), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:60
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval Username"
msgstr "Free-/Bunnen-Afhaal-Brukernaam"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrievePassword), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:64
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval Password"
msgstr "Free-/Bunnen-Afhaal-Passwoort"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyRetrievePassword), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:65
msgid "Password for retrieving free/busy information"
msgstr "Passwoort för't Afhalen vun Free-/Bunnen-Daten"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:76
msgid "Send copy to owner when mailing events"
msgstr "Bi't Loosstüern vun Begeefnissen den Eegner en Kopie tostüern"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:77
msgid ""
"Check this box to get a copy of all e-mail messages that KOrganizer sends at "
"your request to event attendees."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du en Kopie vun all Nettbreven hebben wullt, de KOrganizer "
"för Di de Deelnehmers vun Begeefnissen tostüert."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:82
msgid "Mail transport to use for sending e-mail messages"
msgstr "Överdreegmetood, de Du för't Loosstüern vun Nettbreven bruken wullt"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:83
msgid ""
"If specified all, groupware e-mails will use this transport. Otherwise, the "
"default one will be used."
msgstr ""
"Wenn angeven, bruukt Arbeitkoppel-Nettbreven disse Överdreegmetood, anners "
"de Standardmetood."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (OutlookCompatCounterProposals), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:91
msgid "Send Outlook-like pseudo counter proposals"
msgstr "As-wenn-Gegenvörslääg loosstüern, so as Outlook"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyCheckHostname), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:96
msgid "Check whether hostname and retrieval email address match"
msgstr "Kieken, wat Reeknernaam un Afhaaladress tosamenpasst"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyCheckHostname), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:97
msgid ""
"With this setting you can configure whether the domain part of the free/busy "
"URL has to match the domain part of the user ID you are looking for. For "
"example, if this option is set, then looking for the free/busy data of "
"joe@mydomain.com on the server www.yourdomain.com will fail."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Instellen kannst Du fastleggen, wat de Domään vun en Free-/Bunnen-"
"URL to de Domään vun de Bruker-ID, de Du söken deist, passen mutt. Is dit "
"anmaakt, sleit dat Kieken na de Free-/Bunnen-Daten vun jan@miendomaen.de op "
"den Server www.diendomaen.com fehl."

