#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:234
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The event \"%1\" includes other people.\n"
"Do you want to email the invitation to the attendees?"
msgstr ""
"Dat Begeefnis \"%1\" ümfaat anner Lüüd.\n"
"Wullt Du de Inladen de Deelnehmers tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:238
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The todo \"%1\" includes other people.\n"
"Do you want to email the invitation to the attendees?"
msgstr ""
"De Opgaav \"%1\" ümfaat anner Lüüd.\n"
"Wullt Du de Inladen de Deelnehmers tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:242
msgid ""
"This incidence includes other people. Should an email be sent to the "
"attendees?"
msgstr ""
"Dit Begeefnis ümfaat anner Lüüd. Wullt Du de Deelnehmers en Nettbreef "
"tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:264
msgid ""
"You are not the organizer of this event. Editing it will bring your calendar "
"out of sync with the organizer's calendar. Do you really want to edit it?"
msgstr ""
"Du büst nich dit Begeefnis sien Utrichter. Bewerkst Du dat, fallt Dien "
"Kalenner ut de Synkroniseren to den Utrichter sien. Wullt Du dat redig "
"bewerken?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:297
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You changed the invitation \"%1\".\n"
"Do you want to email the attendees an update message?"
msgstr ""
"Du hest de Inladen \"%1\" ännert.\n"
"Wullt Du de Deelnehmers en Opfrischnaricht tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:301 itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:319
#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:329
msgid "Send Update"
msgstr "Opfrischen loosstüern"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:317 itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:392
msgid "Do you want to send a status update to the organizer of this task?"
msgstr "Wullt Du disse Opgaav sien Utrichter en Statusopfrischen tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:326
msgid ""
"Your status as an attendee of this event changed. Do you want to send a "
"status update to the event organizer?"
msgstr ""
"Dien Status as Deelnehmer vun dit Begeefnis hett sik ännert. Wullt Du dit "
"Begeefnis sien Utrichter en Statusopfrischen tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:363
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You removed the invitation \"%1\".\n"
"Do you want to email the attendees that the event is canceled?"
msgstr ""
"Du hest de Inladen \"%1\" wegmaakt.\n"
"Wullt Du de Deelnehmers de Naricht tostüern, dit Begeefnis is afseggt?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:367
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You removed the invitation \"%1\".\n"
"Do you want to email the attendees that the todo is canceled?"
msgstr ""
"Du hest de Inladen \"%1\" wegmaakt.\n"
"Wullt Du de Deelnehmers de Naricht tostüern, disse Opgaav is afseggt?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You removed the invitation \"%1\".\n"
"Do you want to email the attendees that the journal is canceled?"
msgstr ""
"Du hest de Inladen \"%1\" wegmaakt.\n"
"Wullt Du de Deelnehmers de Naricht tostüern, dit Daagbook is afseggt?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:394
msgid "Do you want to send a status update to the organizer of this journal?"
msgstr "Wullt Du dit Daagbook sien Utrichter en Statusopfrischen tostüern?"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:397 itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:418
msgctxt "@action:button dialog positive answer"
msgid "Send Update"
msgstr "Opfrischen loosstüern"

#: itiphandlerhelper_p.cpp:414
msgid ""
"You had previously accepted an invitation to this event. Do you want to send "
"an updated response to the organizer declining the invitation?"
msgstr ""
